// Paper example 067: Split at a bounded position

#noformat
#paper: 67
#mode: evaluation
#inlinetest:exclude Not an executable S_H/A example; see TestQuantifiedPaperIndex.
#skip
Dependent profile D (out of scope).

-- paper.cue.txt --
split(A, n in Nat, k in int & >=0 & <=n): func(
    xs: Vec(A, n), cut: k,
) -> {left: Vec(A, k), right: Vec(A, n - k)}: {
    left: xs[:cut]
    right: xs[cut:]
}
